    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hekalu kūlombelwa mbango",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni aho wamala ū kūlomba gwika moto kūfuma ng'wigūlū gūūshipemba ī shitambò sha kūpemvwa nī shitambò; nī likūjo lya ng'wa SEEBA lyūyookaja ī hekalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji būlemeelwa ū kwingīla ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA nguno ī likūjo lya ng'wa SEEBA lyalī lyīyookaja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli aho bagūbona ū moto gwika, nī likūjo lya ng'wa SEEBA līl'a higūlya ya hekalu, a bose būtuja mazwi a ha gwaalugwa, binama hasī ū būshū wabo; būnamya ū SEEBA, kūnū bakūnūmbaga balīhaya, “Alī wawiza no, ū būtogwa wakwe būlī wa welelo na welelo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi na a banhū a bose būmfunīja shitambò ū SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Solomoni ūfunya shitambò sha ng'ombe shihūmbī makūmi abīlī na shibīlī, ī ng'holo nī mbūli ī jene jalī shihūmbī igana na makūmi abīlī. Na lūūlū ū ntemi na a banhū a bose bīlombela ī hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji būlī ng'wene wīmīīla h'ipandī lyakwe; a Balawī nabo būshidima ī shikolo shabo sha kwīmbīla, īsho Daūdi walī washibeeja kūlwa nguno ya kūnkumīlīgīja SEEBA; h'īsho shatūmamīlagwa būl'ikanza ūlū akūnūmbaga SEEBA kūlwa nguno ya būtogwa wakwe ūbo būlī wa kūshinga ho welelo na welelo. A bagabīji baalī kū lwandī lūmò bakūfuulaga mhembe jabo, bilolelile na a Balawī; a Baisilaeli a bose baalī bīmīīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni ūlīlombela kwejiwa nī lipandī lya ha gatī gatī ya gwaalugwa ya kū būtongi wa hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, ūfunīja hoi shitambò sha kūpemvwa, na a masazu ga shakwinha sha būsangī. Nguno ū ng'walīlo gwa shaba ūyo walī wagūbeeja gūkalemeelwa ū kūshibūūcha ī shitambò sha kūpemvwa, nī shakwinha sha būsu, na a masazu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Solomoni na a Baisilaeli a bose abo baalī hamò nang'hwe ū lūshikū lwenūlo bīīta shigukulu; lyalī ibità itaale no, banhū baalī bafuma kwandīja Lebo-hamasi kūshisha kū lūbīmbī lwa Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha lūshikū lwa kanaane būbiza na libilinga, nguno bakamala shikū mpungatī balī mu būyegi wa kūgūlombela ū ng'walīlo gwejiwe, hanuma ya henaho būmala hangī shikū jingī mpungatī balī mu būyegi wa shigukulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa makūmi abīlī na'idatū lwa ng'weji gwa mpungatī, ūbalaga a banhū būja kaya bayegaga no, nī ng'holò jabo jazalabanaga kūlwa nguno ya wiza bose ūbo SEEBA akang'wītīla ū Daūdi nū Solomoni, na a banhū bakwe a Baisilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "SEEBA kūng'wilongela Solomoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni aho wamala ū kūzenga ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA nī numba y'ikūlū, ūbiza wamalamaja ū kwīta pyī īyo walī nayo mu maganiko kūlwa nguno ya hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA nī likūlū lyakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lwise lūmo ū SEEBA ūng'wilongela makanza ga būjikū; ūng'wīla, “Ū kūlomba kwako naakwigwaga, nī lipandī lyenīlī naalīkomaga ībize hekalu yane kūlwa nguno ya kūfunīja mo shitambò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūlū gīkī nūlīlugala ī ligūlū, mbula yooya kūtūla, nūūlū nūjilagīja njige kwīkenaagūla ī sī, nūūlū nūbatūmīla ihūūya a banhū bane, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo a banhū bane abo bakitanīlagwa kū lina lyane, ūlū bidoohya na kūlomba na kūnikooba ū nene, hūna būgalūka na kwīnga ū mu nzīla jabo jabūbi, nakwigwa kūfuma ū ng'wigūlū nabalekeje ū būhūbi wabo, nī sī yabo nakwīpīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ī haha nakūgaloleecha a miso gane, na a matū gane nakūgatega nadegeleke ū kūlomba ūko kūkwītagwa ū ng'wipandī lyenīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī hekalu yenīyī nīkomaga, na nīyeejaga gīkī ī lina lyane likale moi shikū jose welelo na welelo. A miso gane, nī ng'holò yane shikūlolela hoi shikū jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ī nhūngwa ja kashimīzīle kako ū kū būtongi wane, ūlū jūbiza gīt'ūmo jalī ja ng'wa so Daūdi, ūbiza nshikīlīja wa yose īyo nīīlagīlile, na a malange gane ūgadima pyī nī shilagīlo shane; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a henaho ī lisumbī lyako lya būtemi nakūlyīta līlame kūshisha welelo bose gīt'ūmo nakalaganīla nū so ū Daūdi nūng'wīla gīkī, ‘Ūtalagayiwa munhū wa kūbasuga a Bisilaeli.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū bebe ūlū ūgalūka, ūnileka ooya ū kūgadima a malange gane, nī shilagīlo īsho naakwinhile, ūlondeela bamulungu bangī wandya kūbatūmamīla na kūbalamya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a henaho nakūbadubbūla gete a Baisilaeli, nabīnje ū mu sī yane īyo naabinha; nī hekalu yenīyī nakwīlema, nūūlū īkī nīyeejaga kūlwa lina lyane. Nakwīyīta ībize gītī shigano, na līshikolo lya kwikala līkūsekagwa sagala ū mu mahanga ga banhū bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nūūlū īkī ī hekalu yenīyī ī haha īlī ya kūkamaaja ū mu wiza, alīyo pye abo bakwībona ūlū balībīta bakūyūshingisha mitwe kūnū bakūhayaga gīkī, ‘Nibūlī ū SEEBA wīyītīlile mhayo gūlī gīko ī sī yenīyī nī hekalu īyī?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū bakūyūshosha balīhaya, ‘Kūlwa nguno bang'wībile ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji babo, ūyo wabenha kūfuma Misili. Banekile būdimana na bamulungu bangī, bandya kūbalamya na kūbatūmamīla; h'ī nguno yene ū SEEBA wabenhelile ū būkenaagūji bose wenūbū!’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
